<h1>Terms of Service</h1>
<p class="muted">Last updated: October 2026</p>

<h2>1. What TradeAutoX is</h2>
<p>TradeAutoX is a <strong>listing venue only</strong> — an online marketplace where licensed wholesale dealers
list vehicles and connect with other licensed dealers. TradeAutoX is <strong>not a party to any transaction</strong>
conducted through the platform.</p>

<h2>2. No transaction processing, no escrow, no commission</h2>
<p>TradeAutoX <strong>processes no vehicle transactions, holds no escrow, and takes no commission or cut</strong>
of any sale. Buyers and sellers transact directly with each other, using whatever payment method they agree upon.
TradeAutoX's sole revenue is the flat monthly membership fee.</p>

<h2>3. All sales as-is, strictly between buyer and seller</h2>
<p>All vehicles listed on TradeAutoX are sold <strong>strictly between buyer and seller, as-is, where-is</strong>,
with no warranties of any kind, express or implied. Any question about a vehicle's condition, history, title
status, or fitness for any purpose is <strong>strictly between the buyer and the seller</strong>.</p>

<h2>4. Disputes</h2>
<p>Any dispute arising from a transaction — including condition disputes or misunderstandings about a listing —
is strictly between the buyer and the seller. TradeAutoX is not a mediator, arbitrator, or party to such disputes.</p>

<h2>5. Disclaimer of liability</h2>
<p>To the fullest extent permitted by law, TradeAutoX disclaims <strong>all liability</strong> for listings,
vehicle condition, vehicle history, title status, and any transaction between members. Members use the platform
at their own risk and are solely responsible for inspecting vehicles and verifying all information before purchase.</p>

<h2>6. Membership eligibility</h2>
<p>Membership is open only to dealers holding a valid wholesale license. Licenses are verified at signup, and
TradeAutoX may suspend or terminate any account found to be ineligible.</p>

<h2>7. Membership fees</h2>
<p>Membership is billed at $599 per month via the member's chosen payment method. Memberships may be cancelled
at any time through the billing portal; access continues through the end of the paid period. Refunds are issued
at TradeAutoX's discretion through our payment processor.</p>

